WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:02.980
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:00.980 --> 00:02.980
Kannazuki no Miko

00:32.600 --> 00:34.220
Souma!

00:42.340 --> 00:43.520
Oogami-kun!

00:44.380 --> 00:46.520
Souma!

01:20.890 --> 01:24.955
Haruka ni sotto yurameku urei
kattou no kioku ni ugokasare

01:24.956 --> 01:29.019
Moving the slowly unfolding, distressing
troubles from afar that were in the past

01:29.020 --> 01:32.085
mabuta ni zutto haritsuku
shiroi zekkyou ni kogoeta

01:32.086 --> 01:35.149
Strongly closing the eyelids,
the white screams have frozen

01:35.150 --> 01:37.280
- shizumu tsuki no mayoi
- The confusion of the setting moon

01:37.910 --> 01:39.680
Sonzai wa tashikani Ima koko ni

01:39.681 --> 01:41.449
Surely my existence is here now

01:41.450 --> 01:43.160
- matte iru no wa
- Waiting for me

01:43.163 --> 01:44.495
Namida nado mou nagasanai

01:44.496 --> 01:45.829
There's no more tears to cry

01:45.830 --> 01:47.955
tada dakiaeru shunkan

01:47.956 --> 01:50.080
When the moment comes when
we embrace each other

01:50.540 --> 01:52.690
ienai kikenai mienai maboroshi dake

01:52.691 --> 01:54.840
Unspoken, unheard, unseen, just an illusion

01:55.050 --> 01:57.490
toki no mukou kawa e to nagasarete

01:57.491 --> 01:59.929
Flowing towards the other side of time,

01:59.930 --> 02:02.265
mayoigo ni naru yurusenu negai

02:02.266 --> 02:04.600
becoming like a lost
child, an unforgiven wish

02:04.890 --> 02:07.080
koe dake yubi dake chikazuku ondo dake

02:07.081 --> 02:09.269
Only voice, only fingers,
only the approaching warmth

02:09.270 --> 02:13.565
todokanu omoi ga chigirarete
yokaze o someru

02:13.566 --> 02:17.860
Unspoken thoughts get tainted
by the shredded night wind

02:29.980 --> 02:32.410
Who is this?

02:36.800 --> 02:37.959
That's right.

02:37.960 --> 02:39.850
I remember.

02:40.490 --> 02:43.970
He's my real...

02:44.100 --> 02:46.540
Fifth Episode

02:46.541 --> 02:48.980
Over the Darkness of Night

03:06.320 --> 03:07.650
What's wrong...

03:08.420 --> 03:09.650
Souma?

03:10.930 --> 03:13.129
This can't be the end.

03:13.130 --> 03:15.889
Since you've decided to fight me...

03:15.890 --> 03:18.460
it shouldn't end like this.

03:19.570 --> 03:20.960
Right?

03:24.870 --> 03:29.930
Hey, you should know by now
what you're supposed to do.

03:30.610 --> 03:31.940
You know, right?

03:33.010 --> 03:34.979
Don't you, Souma?

03:34.980 --> 03:36.940
Don't you?

03:43.820 --> 03:44.950
Good grief.

03:45.420 --> 03:47.050
Stubborn kid.

03:50.630 --> 03:53.200
I'll give you one more chance.

03:58.440 --> 04:00.069
Listen, Souma.

04:00.070 --> 04:03.970
Tomorrow at dawn, I shall return.

04:04.510 --> 04:05.980
At that time...

04:11.150 --> 04:12.380
Niisan...

04:21.930 --> 04:22.930
Himeko!

04:26.630 --> 04:27.740
Himeko!

04:34.370 --> 04:36.250
Himeko, hold on.

04:39.210 --> 04:40.540
Himeko...

04:52.320 --> 04:54.850
Isn't it such a relief...

04:56.160 --> 04:58.560
that his life isn't at risk?

04:59.230 --> 05:01.860
Um, it's just a guess, but...

05:02.470 --> 05:07.100
is that scary person who came
in the afternoon related to this?

05:07.610 --> 05:09.500
Yes, that's right.

05:09.980 --> 05:11.410
Who could he be?

05:11.740 --> 05:14.120
Souma's long-lost brother.

05:14.410 --> 05:16.310
Long-lost brother?

05:16.920 --> 05:19.630
It's what I heard from my father...

05:31.700 --> 05:33.310
He endured.

05:33.830 --> 05:35.310
He kept enduring.

05:35.770 --> 05:40.060
But when he felt his little brother
would be in further danger...

05:42.780 --> 05:45.070
He took his own father's...

05:56.660 --> 06:00.490
He doesn't need a brother who's a murderer.

06:01.790 --> 06:04.050
So I'll cut ties with him.

06:04.400 --> 06:06.790
I'll never see Souma again.

06:07.500 --> 06:10.830
Please take care of my little brother.

06:11.470 --> 06:14.000
And he disappeared.

06:14.710 --> 06:16.420
By their own father...

06:16.680 --> 06:18.330
It's like a living hell.

06:19.750 --> 06:20.810
Yes.

06:23.250 --> 06:25.680
Hey, why, why?

06:26.190 --> 06:28.810
Why not finish him, meow?

06:29.860 --> 06:31.130
Hey.

06:31.590 --> 06:33.329
Hey!

06:33.330 --> 06:35.870
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!

06:43.170 --> 06:47.170
Well, I think it's better
to finish him off quickly.

06:49.010 --> 06:50.899
I think so too, Aneki.

06:50.900 --> 06:54.450
Say, about Hime-chan...

06:56.320 --> 06:59.819
Can I go on a little date
with the Solar Priestess?

06:59.820 --> 07:01.890
I won't break her arms.

07:02.920 --> 07:04.290
Sorry, just kidding.

07:06.760 --> 07:10.060
Tsubasa-sama will make all decisions.

07:11.200 --> 07:12.200
Yes...

07:12.630 --> 07:14.290
Tsubasa-sama will.

07:15.500 --> 07:17.339
Hey, hey, why?

07:17.340 --> 07:19.080
Why, meow?

07:19.570 --> 07:21.140
Boys' love.

07:31.420 --> 07:32.590
Souma.

07:35.050 --> 07:36.590
He's alive.

07:37.860 --> 07:40.600
I remembered, Kazuki-niisan.

07:41.530 --> 07:44.100
Memories from the distant past.

07:44.730 --> 07:47.860
The fearsome shadow that kept beating me.

07:48.110 --> 07:52.830
I was crying in fear, and
he always defended me.

07:54.770 --> 07:57.540
That was my brother, Tsubasa-niisan.

07:59.010 --> 08:02.849
Tsubasa-kun is out to
finish off everything.

08:02.850 --> 08:04.690
What are you going to do?

08:05.950 --> 08:06.980
I...

08:07.620 --> 08:09.289
I will...

08:09.290 --> 08:10.880
I don't know.

08:11.320 --> 08:14.220
What am I supposed to do?

08:25.840 --> 08:27.400
Brother...

08:38.750 --> 08:40.770
Himeko, may I come in?

08:47.060 --> 08:49.959
How are you? Are you hurt anywhere?

08:49.960 --> 08:53.379
If Saturday's revival of Ame
no Murakumo is ill-timed...

08:53.380 --> 08:55.099
we'll talk to the sensei.

08:55.100 --> 08:56.640
The dress.

08:57.020 --> 09:01.039
You treasured your dress, right?

09:01.040 --> 09:02.410
Yet...

09:03.040 --> 09:05.539
Don't worry about it.

09:05.540 --> 09:12.430
You helped so much to make me look nice.

09:13.220 --> 09:14.280
It's okay.

09:14.850 --> 09:16.280
It was fun.

09:17.760 --> 09:21.160
Because you cheered me on.

09:21.660 --> 09:22.660
Yet...

09:24.590 --> 09:26.660
I'm fine as long as you're safe.

09:28.830 --> 09:29.990
Chikane-chan!

09:30.800 --> 09:32.200
Chikane-chan...

09:32.900 --> 09:35.869
I'm sorry, Chikane-chan.

09:35.870 --> 09:36.870
Himeko.

10:13.950 --> 10:15.510
Tsubasa-niisan...

10:16.250 --> 10:19.010
What am I supposed to do?

10:46.680 --> 10:50.680
Somewhere in my heart, I
wished for this to happen.

10:51.680 --> 10:54.750
For her to jump into my arms.

10:55.120 --> 11:01.390
When Himeko was crying, I felt
relief somewhere in my heart.

11:02.360 --> 11:04.020
Himeko...

11:04.860 --> 11:07.790
What am I to you?

11:10.570 --> 11:11.760
A classmate?

11:12.200 --> 11:13.270
A roommate?

11:13.710 --> 11:14.770
A friend?

11:15.110 --> 11:16.280
The Lunar Priestess?

11:16.980 --> 11:18.200
Or...

11:21.950 --> 11:22.950
Himeko.

11:25.100 --> 11:26.249
I...

11:26.250 --> 11:27.480
I...

11:30.860 --> 11:33.290
Ojousama, a guest is here.

11:33.990 --> 11:35.220
A guest?

11:48.570 --> 11:50.079
I'm sorry.

11:50.080 --> 11:54.020
No males except my father are
allowed in this mansion.

11:54.380 --> 11:56.520
So how may I help you?

11:57.280 --> 12:00.760
Can I meet with Hime... with Kurusugawa?

12:01.490 --> 12:03.330
Can you come back tomorrow?

12:03.860 --> 12:05.740
She's very tired.

12:06.090 --> 12:07.529
I know...

12:07.530 --> 12:10.259
But please let me through.

12:10.260 --> 12:12.500
It has to be today, or else...

12:13.030 --> 12:14.030
Or else what?

12:15.370 --> 12:17.250
You mean you won't protect her?

12:17.600 --> 12:21.660
Whose fault do you think it is
that she's in that condition?

12:22.010 --> 12:23.010
I know.

12:23.380 --> 12:26.570
You promised to protect her, right?

12:26.910 --> 12:31.219
You'll protect her even if you
get mentally or physically torn apart.

12:31.220 --> 12:35.519
Don't tell me you said all that
without being prepared for it.

12:35.520 --> 12:36.730
I know.

12:37.090 --> 12:41.160
"What ifs" aren't acceptable.

12:41.460 --> 12:42.980
I won't allow it.

12:43.460 --> 12:45.740
If it were me... If it were me...

12:46.430 --> 12:47.730
What if it was you?

12:49.410 --> 12:50.750
What can you do?

12:51.300 --> 12:54.750
So why don't you hurry up
and revive Ame no Murakumo?

12:57.880 --> 13:02.509
Sorry, I didn't mean to blame you...
to blame the two of you.

13:02.510 --> 13:04.580
Of course you're upset.

13:05.080 --> 13:08.189
I really was out of my mind, sorry.

13:08.190 --> 13:12.140
No, I was the one who said too much.

13:12.460 --> 13:14.020
I'll go now.

13:14.630 --> 13:17.320
Good night. Say hi to Kurusugawa for me.

13:21.230 --> 13:24.360
I don't have the right to say anything.

13:27.840 --> 13:29.900
Ame no Murakumo.

13:48.630 --> 13:51.060
It's a nice night, right, Souma?

13:51.330 --> 13:53.520
You're right, Tsubasa-niisan.

13:54.600 --> 13:56.420
Looks like you remembered.

13:56.940 --> 13:57.940
I'm glad.

13:58.300 --> 13:59.840
I'm glad, too.

14:04.570 --> 14:05.640
So...

14:07.540 --> 14:09.570
Have your feelings changed a bit?

14:10.520 --> 14:11.920
I'm not sure.

14:12.220 --> 14:15.570
But I can't choose not to fight.

14:15.890 --> 14:17.110
I see.

14:33.910 --> 14:35.130
Himeko.

14:42.510 --> 14:44.149
Oh, this is...

14:44.150 --> 14:45.619
What's up?

14:45.620 --> 14:47.650
Very different from yesterday.

14:47.900 --> 14:49.320
What happened?

14:50.960 --> 14:52.359
I see.

14:52.360 --> 14:55.029
You've accepted the Orochi power in you.

14:55.030 --> 14:57.410
Good, very good.

14:57.800 --> 15:00.379
This is who you really are.

15:00.380 --> 15:02.919
Release your power more.

15:02.920 --> 15:05.380
You shall become more like me!

15:07.880 --> 15:10.380
Come, Souma! More!

15:13.780 --> 15:15.390
Are you all right, Himeko?

15:15.880 --> 15:17.390
You should take it easy.

15:17.920 --> 15:19.179
Say...

15:19.180 --> 15:20.890
Yes, what is it, Himeko?

15:21.520 --> 15:24.400
Take me to where Oogami-kun is.

15:31.110 --> 15:33.319
That's not enough yet.

15:33.320 --> 15:35.490
What are you doing, Souma?

15:44.910 --> 15:46.920
Please, Chikane-chan.

15:48.210 --> 15:50.680
That's rash. It's too dangerous.

15:51.820 --> 15:54.600
Who knows what will happen if we get near.

15:54.920 --> 15:56.189
I know.

15:56.190 --> 15:57.190
I'm scared.

15:57.990 --> 15:59.650
Really scared.

16:00.360 --> 16:03.520
But... But I have to go.

16:03.860 --> 16:05.529
I have to go.

16:05.530 --> 16:09.030
I need to do what I can.

16:09.470 --> 16:11.920
Because I made a promise with you.

16:12.940 --> 16:14.030
Himeko.

16:14.470 --> 16:17.100
Please, Chikane-chan, please.

16:18.840 --> 16:20.070
All right.

16:20.510 --> 16:22.000
Let's go together.

16:22.810 --> 16:26.050
I sense it. I sense you, Souma.

16:26.380 --> 16:27.880
Don't you feel it, too?

16:28.140 --> 16:29.819
You're an Orochi.

16:29.820 --> 16:31.380
You're indeed my little brother.

16:31.910 --> 16:33.890
Why, Tsubasa-niisan?

16:34.260 --> 16:38.060
Why do we have to destroy
the world as Orochi?

16:38.600 --> 16:41.770
There's no reason for us to fight.

16:42.200 --> 16:45.700
Let's fight to defend the world together.

16:46.070 --> 16:50.279
I'm doing that, so there should
be no reason why you can't.

16:50.280 --> 16:51.400
Right?

16:58.480 --> 16:59.879
Are you all right, Himeko?

16:59.880 --> 17:02.660
I'm fine because I'm with you.

17:06.020 --> 17:07.670
For the world, huh?

17:08.730 --> 17:11.009
I've no reason to defend it.

17:11.010 --> 17:12.170
Not one!

17:27.110 --> 17:28.480
Souma.

17:28.810 --> 17:32.070
Have you eaten leftovers in an alley?

17:32.570 --> 17:36.070
Have you been backstabbed by
one you believed a friend?

17:36.390 --> 17:41.120
Have you begged for your life
from the person you wanted dead?

17:42.240 --> 17:44.850
There's no way you have, right, Souma?

17:46.130 --> 17:48.369
That's how it should be.

17:48.370 --> 17:50.290
I wanted you to take the path...

17:50.700 --> 17:54.250
where the sun shines on
you, a warm and peaceful life.

17:56.440 --> 17:59.050
That's why I left you behind!

18:07.990 --> 18:12.270
But now I regret it from
the bottom of my heart.

18:12.660 --> 18:15.329
If I'd known, I would've taken your hand...

18:15.330 --> 18:18.280
and dragged you into
the world of darkness.

18:18.800 --> 18:21.029
I should've shown you.

18:21.030 --> 18:24.110
The absolute proof that this world is hell.

18:28.540 --> 18:31.790
A world where brothers like you
and me have to fight each other?

18:33.370 --> 18:36.450
What else can you call it?

18:37.820 --> 18:42.619
You see, Souma. When I found
out that we were Orochi...

18:42.620 --> 18:44.900
I was glad from the bottom of my heart.

18:45.190 --> 18:49.129
I could regain the bond with
you that I once let go.

18:49.130 --> 18:51.799
I thought we could be brothers again.

18:51.800 --> 18:52.810
Yet...

18:53.200 --> 18:55.030
Yet you...

18:57.280 --> 18:58.819
Get tainted.

18:58.820 --> 19:01.909
Get tainted with the Orochi like me!

19:01.910 --> 19:03.830
That's the real you!

19:04.140 --> 19:05.830
That's my little brother!

19:16.910 --> 19:18.670
Be reborn, Souma.

19:19.660 --> 19:21.060
Oogami-kun...

19:22.360 --> 19:23.390
Oogami-kun.

19:27.470 --> 19:29.120
Oogami-kun!

19:33.070 --> 19:34.480
It's you.

19:34.910 --> 19:36.910
So it's you...

19:39.170 --> 19:44.410
The one who ruined Souma
was you, Solar Priestess!

19:47.350 --> 19:49.080
I won't let you.

19:50.160 --> 19:52.420
I won't let you, no matter what!

19:55.680 --> 19:57.250
Souma...

19:59.200 --> 20:00.590
Niisan...

20:01.770 --> 20:04.960
It was you who saved my life.

20:05.640 --> 20:08.269
I've only lived for 16 years.

20:08.270 --> 20:10.230
I'm a kid who knows nothing.

20:10.580 --> 20:13.039
There's no way I can understand...

20:13.040 --> 20:17.730
the hell you've seen or if
this world is worth defending.

20:18.350 --> 20:20.349
But you see...

20:20.350 --> 20:22.740
there's a person I love.

20:24.820 --> 20:27.989
She's always suffering and crying.

20:27.990 --> 20:31.160
That's why I want to protect her.

20:31.180 --> 20:33.250
I want to make her smile.

20:33.970 --> 20:36.240
I want to give her happiness.

20:37.480 --> 20:40.000
That's why the world isn't hell.

20:40.440 --> 20:43.760
I won't let it become hell!

20:44.000 --> 20:45.139
Fine.

20:45.140 --> 20:50.470
I'll beat you till your resolve cracks,
and your will to fight is broken.

21:16.410 --> 21:17.679
Himeko.

21:17.680 --> 21:19.830
What happened to Oogami-kun?

21:50.780 --> 21:52.260
Oogami-kun...

21:54.650 --> 21:55.960
Himeko.

22:00.390 --> 22:01.960
Tsubasa-niisan...

22:10.020 --> 22:11.700
- Itsuka mita yume
- A dream that was once saw

22:11.703 --> 22:13.710
- Todokanai tsubuyaki dake
- Just a murmur that does not get through

22:13.713 --> 22:15.515
Yoru no hikari ni tsutsumarete samayoi yuku

22:15.516 --> 22:17.319
Wandering while wrapped up in night's light

22:17.320 --> 22:20.900
- Yagate mihiraku sono hitomi Unmei nara - If it
is fate, those eyes will be opened before long

22:20.903 --> 22:22.425
Semete Sou ima dake

22:22.426 --> 22:23.949
At least... yes, only now

22:23.950 --> 22:26.310
- Kanawanai to utsumuku - Looking
downward as the wish does not come true

22:26.313 --> 22:28.310
- Yokaze ni tada unadare
- Merely hanging my head in the night wind

22:28.313 --> 22:32.000
- Namida Tsukikage Te no hira ni afurete yuku - Tears
and moonlight continue to overflow from my palm

22:32.003 --> 22:33.570
- Nani ga hoshii no
- What do you want?

22:33.573 --> 22:35.790
Kuchibiru wa yami ni furuete ita

22:35.791 --> 22:38.009
My lips shivered in the darkness

22:38.010 --> 22:40.350
Deatta ano toki ni mune tsuita egao

22:40.351 --> 22:42.689
The smiling face that pierced
my chest when we came across

22:42.690 --> 22:45.630
Mamoritakute Zutto kuzuresou na yakusoku o

22:45.631 --> 22:48.569
I want to protect it, the promise
that always looks about to collapse

22:48.570 --> 22:50.605
Itami tsubusu hodo ni dakishimeteta

22:50.606 --> 22:52.640
I embraced it while crushing the pain

22:53.480 --> 22:54.895
Soba ni ireru dake de

22:54.896 --> 22:56.309
Just by being by my side

22:56.310 --> 22:58.120
Onaji jikan ni irareru dake de

22:58.121 --> 22:59.929
Just by remaining in the same time as me

22:59.930 --> 23:03.400
Tooi kioku Yomigaeru kanashimi
mo atatamete yukeru no ni

23:03.401 --> 23:06.869
The distant memory and
revived sadness can warmed

23:06.870 --> 23:08.850
Mawaritsuzukete iru omoi ni

23:08.851 --> 23:10.829
In the feelings that continue to circulate

23:10.830 --> 23:12.645
Yasuragi michita owari wa kuru no

23:12.646 --> 23:14.459
Will a peaceful ending come?

23:14.460 --> 23:16.280
Kurikaeshita toikake wa ten ni mai

23:16.281 --> 23:18.099
The repeated question dance in heavens

23:18.100 --> 23:23.625
Ake no sora no Hikari ni kawaru

23:23.626 --> 23:29.150
And turns into the light of the morning sky

23:39.980 --> 23:40.985
Next Time

23:40.986 --> 23:41.990
Next Time

23:41.991 --> 23:44.540
The person lingered in the spring sunlight.

23:45.620 --> 23:49.659
Brighter than the sun, more
elegant than butterflies...

23:49.660 --> 23:52.240
and more beautiful than a flower garden.

23:52.580 --> 23:55.659
Unaware of the fate beyond this meeting...

23:55.660 --> 23:58.690
a maiden is charmed and
soaked in the maiden's presence.

23:59.000 --> 23:59.999
Where the Sun Shines

24:00.000 --> 24:03.369
Next time on Kannazuki no Miko, episode 6.

24:03.370 --> 24:05.000
Where the Sun Shines.

24:05.340 --> 24:08.510
Chikane-chan, what am I supposed to do?
